            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:3985">bla ma yang dag pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen</rs> bden gnyis seng <choice><orig>nge'i</orig><reg>ge'i</reg></choice> nga ros mtha' gnyis su 'dzin pa'i ri dags skrag <pb edRef="inst:4881" n="8b"/><lb edRef="inst:4881" n="8b1"/> par mdzad cing ¦ skye dgu ma lus pa'i mgon skyabs dam par gyur pa'i yon tan ri rab ltar brjid pa las nyung 'bru tsam zhig <rs type="place" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4411">snar thang</rs> du sdebs pa'o ||<note type="editorial">Compare with the colophon of the same text found in the Snar thang gser phreng: bla ma yang dag pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen bden gnyis seng ge'i nga ros mtha' gnyis su 'dzin pa'i ri dags sgrag par mdzad cing | skye dgu ma lus pa'i mgon skyabs dam par gyur pa'i yon tan ri rab ltar brjid pa las nyung 'bru tsam zhig <rs type="place">dpal snar thang gi gtsug lag khang</rs> du <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3977">dge slong nam mkha' grags</rs> kyis bsdebs pa'o || <note type="gloss">cig zhus <expan>bgyis so</expan></note> ||</note></seg></ab>
